# Cline Rules — Angular 21 Project

All project rules are defined in `AGENTS.md` at the repository root.

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` for architecture, coding standards, component
patterns, banned patterns, and the Angular 18 → 21 migration playbook.

For detailed reference:
- `docs/PROJECT.md` — business domain
- `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` — system design, signals, zoneless, hydration
- `docs/CONVENTIONS.md` — naming (v21 style guide), structure
- `docs/TESTING.md` — Vitest setup, Karma migration
- `docs/MIGRATION_18_TO_21.md` — step-by-step upgrade path

Cline also reads `AGENTS.md` and any files under `.clinerules/` if present.
